{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Shared bbox->head math test vectors consumed by both tests/test_bbox_math_vectors.py (smartxr.geometry) and godot-android/tests/script_only_bbox_math_probe.gd (AndroidMovingCard.gd). Regenerate with tools/generate_bbox_math_test_vectors.py.",
